{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"inductor-calculator UI copy.fields.accuracyNote","detected_language":"sw","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"inductor-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote","keys":["inductor-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote"],"locale":"sw","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Makadirio tu. hewa-kiini mfano hutumia Wheeler ya single-safu approximation na ni mwongozo kavu wakati kipenyo coil ni chini ya ZXQPH0000QXZ × winding urefu. Ni omits waya unene, nafasi, karibu chuma, vipindi, capacitance wadudu na vigezo kipimo. Kwa toroid, kuingia sababu AL kutoka datasheet yake hasa msingi; AL na permeability inaweza kubadilika na vipindi, joto, DC ubaguzi, pengo na uvumilivu viwanda. Kuhakikisha yoyote ya kweli kubuni na kiini mtengenezaji na kipimo.","record_id":"a619ca814b2d98ee89f28ece6b792405f097c7bd4af8bebf97b2f9b40ff38366","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":2.410362448374997,"source":"Estimate only. The air-core model uses Wheeler’s single-layer approximation and is a rough guide when coil diameter is less than 3× winding length. It omits wire thickness, spacing, nearby metal, frequency, parasitic capacitance and measurement conditions. For a toroid, enter the AL factor from its exact core datasheet; AL and permeability can change with frequency, temperature, DC bias, gap and manufacturing tolerance. Verify any real design with the core manufacturer and measurement.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"afb560136b551f41a3012376f29e0acf944d00215a9916e516e2d603237c8159","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Makadirio tu. hewa-kiini mfano hutumia Wheeler ya single-safu approximation na ni mwongozo kavu wakati kipenyo coil ni chini ya 3 × winding urefu. Ni omits waya unene, nafasi, karibu chuma, vipindi, capacitance wadudu na vigezo kipimo. Kwa toroid, kuingia sababu AL kutoka datasheet yake hasa msingi; AL na permeability inaweza kubadilika na vipindi, joto, DC ubaguzi, pengo na uvumilivu viwanda. Kuhakikisha yoyote ya kweli kubuni na kiini mtengenezaji na kipimo.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
